   "why": "NEAT 16 plus three lessons from the ladder. (1) No compass inputs: cos/sin(heading) are useless on random tracks,\nand in n00 evolution had already cut cos(heading) off. (2) Five tracks per generation instead of three, so a network\ncan't win by drawing easy tracks. (3) A stronger lap-time bonus (2 per frame) to push harder for speed."
